From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: babarot <b4b4r07@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 19:04:17 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Drop the extra document from the frontend lockfile

The v1.4.0 release rewrote pnpm-lock.yaml with a newer pnpm, which put
its own version in a first YAML document. pnpm 10.28, the version
package.json pins, reads only a single document and refuses to install.
---
 internal/frontend/pnpm-lock.yaml | 94 --------------------------------
 1 file changed, 94 deletions(-)

diff --git a/internal/frontend/pnpm-lock.yaml b/internal/frontend/pnpm-lock.yaml
index f2c3f55..c8dfc00 100644
--- a/internal/frontend/pnpm-lock.yaml
+++ b/internal/frontend/pnpm-lock.yaml
@@ -1,97 +1,3 @@
----
